{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_support", "label": "Deno best-effort support", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Core actor APIs behave identically; only subsystems with native dependencies vary. Production is still recommended on Bun or Node because Deno does not get the same depth of testing."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_sqlite_gap", "label": "SQLite unsupported on Deno", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deno has no built-in SQLite and neither bun:sqlite nor better-sqlite3 load natively, so the routes out are a Deno-native package behind a hand-written Journal, an HTTP-backed journal, or Cassandra for multi-node persistence."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_hono_websocket_backend", "label": "Hono backend for websocket() on Deno", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The websocket() route needs the HTTP backend's upgrade support; DenoHonoRunner wires it onto Deno.serve plus Deno.upgradeWebSocket, so no hand-written adapter is required."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_permissions_model", "label": "Deno permissions model", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Explicit allow flags surface misconfigurations that pass silently on Node (a narrow --allow-net makes the 2552 bind fail loudly); production should narrow to specific ports and env prefixes."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_deploy_mismatch", "label": "Deno Deploy is not a long-running runtime", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Short-lived isolates spawned per request do not fit clustering; use actor-ts as a library inside a handler invocation, or run Deno on a real VM."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_migration_checklist", "label": "Migrating to Deno", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verify peer deps resolve through npm: specifiers, replace SQLite, replace websocket() routes or use SSE, and test cluster formation thoroughly because Deno's TCP backend has the fewest production hours."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_support", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_sqlite_gap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_support", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_hono_websocket_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_support", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_permissions_model", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/runtime/deno.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_runtime_deno_deno_deploy_mismatch", "target": "docs_